ccec-5fdc-b7d9-036e8a7dc23c))(global_label "GND_SYS" (shape bidirectional) (at 76.2 68.58 180) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify right)) (uuid 50bb4eae-699e-5079-8a97-e9d980b29156))(text "Uses the common-port BMS topology: charge positive -> F601 -> F101 -> pack positive; return -> protected BMS return." (at 20 124 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 65cf350e-25a6-513c-92b7-917d1bc8eef0))(text "If the selected BMS has a separate C- port, this sheet MUST change. Never wire charger return directly to raw cell negative." (at 20 136 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7aad6ecf-582d-5d7d-8e70-255bfb36f10a))(text "Use a finished 6S Li-ion charger with termination, temperature policy and reverse-current protection; 4A is a candidate limit." (at 20 148 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5eea7769-6121-567d-9985-47a3a26128a1))(text "Prototype charging procedure: service switch OFF; appropriate pack/BMS fitted; one source; no energized motion." (at 20 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 911c6010-8f42-56d4-bf5c-f4c30f3f7703))(text "NOT IN THIS REVISION: unattended dock contacts/interlock, parallel solar + mains sources, charge-source OR-ing or supercapacitors." (at 20 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5dcfa7da-d33e-5668-87db-2ce7ffcaa01b))(text "Station PV / LiFePO4 / buck-boost charger remains an EXTERNAL subsystem in the architecture drawing. No station PCB is implied." (at 20 192 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9aaac7ce-71e1-5c53-95c7-ed8925d58eaf))(text "The original T12 dock/battery is independent. Neither T12 battery terminals nor its 20V charging input accepts 25.2V directly." (at 20 204 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid c05933d3-c930-55fe-928c-16c921051184))(text "Mechanical connector selection, touch protection and fuse coordination are still required before connecting real batteries." (at 20 224 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 35d87465-e8c7-5798-8df3-4500be60d9f5)) (embedded_fonts no))